      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72054896843546624
    m_Localized: Start the game to start the game
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72054985590824960
    m_Localized: The infected person needs to infect the survivors. If there are
      no survivors, the infected person will win. But if the survivors last the whole
      round, the survivors will win.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72055090586836992
    m_Localized: Hold right click to grapple
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72055200288858112
    m_Localized: After a kill, you need to take their banana soul, otherwise it will
      not count as a kill
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72055270237265920
    m_Localized: Press F5 to retry
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72055427947290624
    m_Localized: Press E to ready
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72055474613116928
    m_Localized: Right click to show mouse
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72055641022128128
    m_Localized: Press F1 to kick, Press F2 to not kick
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72055757225320448
    m_Localized: As an infected, you have superspeed, many jumps, and the dash ability.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72058311053139968
    m_Localized: Press E to interact
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
