  - m_Id: 83104177924317184
    m_Localized: Good job rebel, keep it up
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83104216520302592
    m_Localized: That was a good fight, you are the person that i needed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83104404752277504
    m_Localized: Don't be sad, evil will always be defeated
