  - m_Id: 83401314012733440
    m_Localized: Perk
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83464252526403584
    m_Localized: Use this for wall running
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83464648506449920
    m_Localized: Quick Hand makes your reload faster just like reload go brrrrrrrrrrrrr
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83464695826587648
    m_Localized: This makes you jump VERY HIGH so you can go to space, like a frog
      if you know what i mean
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83464729955639296
    m_Localized: If you are blind and cannot see where your getting hit at, this
      perk can help you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83464764109856768
    m_Localized: This makes you slower, but you deal more damage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83464802022170624
    m_Localized: This makes you fat, meaning you will move slow but you get more
      health
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83464867809828864
    m_Localized: This perk can make your hands more metal like, meaning that it reduces
      recoil
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
