  - m_Id: 87852516372881408
    m_Localized: Host your own server and let other players join <size=12><color=red>Warning
      Players with low configuration are not recommended to create servers </color>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87853506333483008
    m_Localized: Browse the server list
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87853540571586560
    m_Localized: Practice your skills
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88815895119896576
    m_Localized: You can practice your skills in the Shooting Range
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88816078171906048
    m_Localized: Wait for enough players to ready up to start the game
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88818164833951744
    m_Localized: Kill everyone you see, and when the timer runs out, the player with
      the most kills will win the match
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88818506631979008
    m_Localized: Eliminate the opposing team. The team with the highest combined
      kill count will win at the end of the match.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88819226647175168
    m_Localized: Kill everyone you see and collect their banana soul.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88819581359464448
    m_Localized: 'Just like brawl, but your weapons are randomized. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88819359287844864
    m_Localized: After 15 seconds an infected player will spawn, their job is to
      infect other players who then infect everyone else.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88819500476506112
    m_Localized: Keep yourself in the circle. The player who was in the circle for
      the longest amount of time wins the match.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88819926793953280
    m_Localized: After a certain amount of kills, your weapon will be changed into
      the next weapon on the cycle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
